    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="44.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 44.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf him man wyrne, gebete þæt wið ðone kyningc mid hundtwentig scyllinga oððe geladige hine—nime V men ⁊ beo him sylf VI-ta.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone refuses it to him, he shall make amends for it to the king by the payment of 120 shillings, or he shall clear himself. He shall select five men and be himself a sixth.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif him hwa wyrne, gebete þæt wið þone cing mid CXX scyll'; oðþe geladige hine; nime V ⁊ beo sylf syxta.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
